    "text": "Mandarin has four tones. Mā is high and flat, má goes up, mǎ dips down and up, mà falls.",
    "examples": [
      "mā: tone 1",
      "mà: tone 4"
    ],
    "reteach": "Move your hand with your voice: flat, up, down and up, then down."
